<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ProSource raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ProSource raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded ProSource Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept ProSource as a long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ProSource gained 5/8 to 11-1/8.</p>
